      "statement": "EmbeddingCreator.create(configuration) resolves the default CacheManager only for caching platforms: for the MOCK platform it returns a MockEmbeddingCreator (zero vectors of length 1, no cache, no environment reads) before the manager is touched, so a mock creator requires no cache setup.",
