      "id": "claim_c5ea60671ab3493c982fb17ec184d06d",
      "statement": "CacheManager is the cache entry point: setCacheDir(dir[, environment]) must run before getDefaultInstance() (which throws IllegalStateException until then), getCache(origin, parameters) memoizes caches by sanitized name and rejects reuse with unequal parameters, builds the backend stack from CACHE_HIERARCHY (default LOCAL) folding multiple CacheTypes into HierarchicalCache with the CACHE_REPLACEMENT_STRATEGY (default NONE), and flush() persists every managed cache.",
      "evidence": [
