    {
      "id": "claim_bf79ecd685174cb8bc840ba4be9670fc",
      "statement": "Each CacheManager holds the EnvironmentProvider it was created with, reads CACHE_HIERARCHY and CACHE_REPLACEMENT_STRATEGY from it at construction, and passes it to the Redis-based backends: RedisCache reads REDIS_URL (default redis://localhost:6379) and RestRedisCache reads REST_REDIS_URI with optional REST_REDIS_USERNAME/REST_REDIS_PASSWORD, both failing fast with IllegalStateException when the backend PING fails.",
