    {
      "id": "claim_1c220db2a20b45c8a6d06688939cdef0",
      "statement": "The library builds on Java 21 with the io.github.ardoco:parent 2.1.0 parent POM and LangChain4j 1.22.0 imported as a BOM, using jtokkit 1.1.0 for token counting, org.fuchss:rest-redis 0.1.5 for the REST-Redis client, dotenv-java 3.2.0 for .env support, and Testcontainers (2.0.5 BOM, test scope) for the Docker-gated integration test; flatten-maven-plugin is pinned to 1.7.3 because the ardoco parent references it unversioned and 1.8.0 has an NPE regression in its CI-friendly interpolator, and central-publishing overrides deploymentName to ardoco-llm-access with autoPublish and waitUntil published.",
